    "%@. Culla keeps trying with every change; your decisions stay on screen. Check that the startup disk has free space." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of 'Decisions not saved' in the status bar. %@ is the error, such as 'Could not save: The disk is full' (already translated, without a final full stop).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. Culla повторяет попытку при каждом изменении; ваши решения остаются на экране. Проверьте, есть ли свободное место на загрузочном диске."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. Culla her üýtgeşmede täzeden synanyşýar; kararlaryňyz ekranda galýar. Ulgam diskinde boş ýeriň bardygyny barlaň."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: no key" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver name of the empty key box in Settings ▸ Keys for a command that has no key. %@ is the command's name. Also: What VoiceOver reads for a row of the Keyboard Shortcuts window when the command has no key. %@ is the command's name, such as 'Keep'.",
