    "%@: off" : {
      "comment" : "The count line under a detection control that is switched off, in Settings and in the tuning panel: 'Eyes closed: off'. %@ is the name of what the control counts, such as 'Eyes closed'. 'off' means the check is disabled. Small caption, little room.",
