            "value" : "Ýygnalan tapgyr barada kadrma-kadr karar berilýär: gözden geçirmek üçin %@ basyň."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A photo without a decision or a rating gets no sidecar. An existing sidecar is merged; everything else in it is kept." : {
      "comment" : "Note under the Sidecars section in Settings ▸ General.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
