    "Core Image and ImageIO, on this Mac only. No network access." : {
      "comment" : "Second credit line in the About window, in small type, under 'Built with Apple Vision'. Core Image and ImageIO are Apple framework names, not translated. Says analysis happens on this computer only and the app never uses the network.",
