          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» hereketi ýerine ýetirilýärkä Culla ýapyldy. Edilenleri yzyna almalymy?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Culla’s docs folder holds the design, the user flows and the plan, as Markdown files. Keyboard Shortcuts in this menu lists every key." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the alert after Help ▸ Culla Documentation. 'docs' is a folder's name (keep as is); 'Markdown' is a file format; 'Keyboard Shortcuts' is the Help menu item of that name, so use the same words as that item.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В папке docs проекта Culla лежат описание дизайна, пользовательские сценарии и план — в файлах Markdown. Пункт «Сочетания клавиш» в этом меню показывает все клавиши."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Culla çeşme kodunyň docs bukjasynda dizaýn, ulanyş ssenariýleri we meýilnama Markdown faýllary görnüşinde saklanýar. Şu menýudaky «Düwme utgaşmalary» ähli düwmeleri görkezýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Culla’s next best frame" : {
