            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu suratdaky her ýüz; ýumuk gözler mämişi çyzyk bilen gurşalan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each photo in flight needs about 256 MB, so %lld GB of memory allows %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ Performance, a sentence in the explanation under 'Photos analysed at once', on a Mac with little memory. 'In flight' means being analysed right now. %1$lld is the Mac's memory in gigabytes; %2$lld is how many photos that allows at once. Translate the units MB and GB as your language abbreviates them.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each photo in flight needs about 256 MB, so %1$lld GB of memory allows %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждому анализируемому фото нужно около 256 МБ, поэтому %1$lld ГБ памяти хватает на %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Derňelýän her surata takmynan 256 MB gerek, şonuň üçin %1$lld GB ýat bir wagtda %2$lld surata ýetýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every change is recorded as it is made, so whatever is done can be undone." : {
      "comment" : "The progress panel while Culla applies decisions: reassurance under the progress bar.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждое изменение записывается сразу, поэтому всё сделанное можно отменить."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Her üýtgeşme edilen badyna ýazga alynýar, şonuň üçin edilen islendik zady yzyna alyp bolýar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every culling action is one key. Unreviewed photos count as kept, so you only have to find the rejects." : {
      "comment" : "Introduction at the top of the Keyboard Shortcuts window. 'Culling' is sorting photos into keepers and rejects. 'Unreviewed' photos are those not yet kept or rejected.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждое действие отбора — одна клавиша. Непросмотренные фото считаются оставленными, так что достаточно найти те, что нужно отклонить."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Surat saýlamagyň her hereketi bir düwme bilen edilýär. Seredilmedik suratlar galdyrylan hasaplanýar, şonuň üçin diňe ret etmeli suratlary tapmak ýeterlik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every duplicate set has a decision" : {
      "comment" : "Heading shown over duplicate review once every set is decided.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "По каждому набору дубликатов принято решение"
