    "Keeps one copy of every byte-identical set still undecided and rejects the rest, in one step (%@). Near-duplicates are never accepted in bulk." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the Accept All Exact Duplicates button. %@ is its key, such as ⇧↩ (never translated).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Одним шагом оставляет по одной копии в каждом наборе точных дубликатов, где ещё нет решения, и отклоняет остальные (%@). Почти одинаковые копии никогда не принимаются все сразу."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entek karar berilmedik her takyk dublikat toplumyndan bir nusgany galdyrýar we galanlaryny ret edýär, bir ädimde (%@). Takmyny dublikatlar hiç haçan köpçülikleýin kabul edilmeýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps one copy of every byte-identical set still undecided and rejects the rest, in one step. Near-duplicates are never accepted in bulk." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the Accept All Exact Duplicates button, when no key is set for it.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Одним шагом оставляет по одной копии в каждом наборе точных дубликатов, где ещё нет решения, и отклоняет остальные. Почти одинаковые копии никогда не принимаются все сразу."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entek karar berilmedik her takyk dublikat toplumyndan bir nusgany galdyrýar we galanlaryny ret edýär, bir ädimde. Takmyny dublikatlar hiç haçan köpçülikleýin kabul edilmeýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept and unreviewed photos are copied, with their RAW files and sidecars, into a folder you choose, keeping their subfolders." : {
      "comment" : "Review and Apply on a read-only shoot, before a folder is chosen: what Copy Keepers will do.",
