    "Only undecided photos flagged Certain in %@ are rejected. Nothing is moved until you apply." : {
      "comment" : "Detail text of the alert that asks to reject every photo the app is certain about in a group (⇧X), such as 'Reject 6 photos that are certainly blurry?'. %@ is the sidebar group's name, such as 'Blurry' or 'Eyes Closed'. 'Certain' is the name of the higher confidence tier shown on badges (use the same word as there). 'Apply' means carrying out the decisions on the files (Review and Apply). A sentence about Undo follows it.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
