    },
    "Sort a shoot into keepers and rejects, from the keyboard." : {
      "comment" : "The tagline under the app's name on the welcome screen. Also: The one-line description of the app in the About window. 'Shoot' is the set of photos from one photo session; 'keepers' the photos kept, 'rejects' those rejected. The window is 360 points wide; the line may wrap.",
