          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tor bilen bir uly suratyň arasynda geç"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect the next time Culla opens. System default uses the first of Culla’s languages in your list in System Settings, or English if none is there." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the Language menu in Settings ▸ General: a change applies after Culla is reopened; 'System default' picks the first of Culla's languages (English, Russian, Turkmen) found in the person's preferred-language list in macOS System Settings, else English. 'System Settings' is the name of the macOS app; use its name in your language. 'Culla' is the app's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вступает в силу при следующем запуске Culla. Вариант «Как в системе» берёт первый из языков Culla в вашем списке языков в Системных настройках, а если там нет ни одного — английский."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Culla indiki gezek açylanda güýje girýär. «Ulgam boýunça» saýlananda macOS sazlamalaryndaky dil sanawyňyzda Culla goldaýan dilleriň ilkinjisi ulanylýar, hiç biri ýok bolsa — iňlis dili."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld photos you rejected are not copied." : {
      "comment" : "Review and Apply on a read-only shoot: a line of what Copy Keepers will do. %lld is the number of rejected photos.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
