      }
    },
    "The changes stay. Undo Apply in the Edit menu can still take them back." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the 'Keep as Is' button. 'Undo Apply' is a menu command and 'Edit' the menu's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Изменения остаются. Их всё ещё можно вернуть командой «Отменить применение» в меню «Правка»."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Üýtgeşmeler galýar. «Düzediş» menýusyndaky «Ulanmagy yzyna al» olary henizem yzyna alyp bilýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copies Culla made are removed, unless they were changed since. “%@” itself is not touched." : {
      "comment" : "The confirmation alert of Undo Apply, after Copy Keepers: what undoing does. %@ is the shoot folder's name (never translated).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Копии, сделанные Culla, удаляются, если с тех пор они не изменялись. Сама папка «%@» не затрагивается."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Culla eden nusgalar aýrylýar, ýöne şondan bäri üýtgedilenlerine degilmeýär. «%@» bukjasynyň özüne degilmeýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The documentation is in Culla’s source code" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an alert after Help ▸ Culla Documentation when the documentation folder is not on this Mac. Culla is the app's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
