            "value" : "Возможно, папка перемещена или находится на диске или карте, которые не подключены."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bukja başga ýere geçirilen bolmagy mümkin, ýa-da ol birikdirilmedik diskde ýa-da kartda ýerleşýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image data is damaged or incomplete." : {
      "comment" : "Why a photo has no thumbnail or analysis: shown in the inspector and tile tooltip for a damaged file.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Данные изображения повреждены или неполны."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Surat maglumatlary zaýalanan ýa-da doly däl."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photos go back to where they were in “%@”, with their decisions, and the sidecars Culla wrote are put back as they were. Anything changed since is left alone and listed; nothing is overwritten." : {
      "comment" : "The confirmation alert of Undo Apply, after rejects were moved: what undoing does. %@ is the shoot folder's name (never translated).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Фото вернутся на прежние места в «%@» вместе с решениями, а файлы XMP, записанные Culla, станут такими, как были. Всё, что с тех пор изменилось, остаётся как есть и попадает в список; ничего не перезаписывается."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suratlar kararlary bilen bilelikde «%@» bukjasyndaky öňki ýerine gaýdýar, Culla ýazan XMP faýllary bolsa öňki ýagdaýyna getirilýär. Şondan bäri üýtgedilen zatlara degilmeýär we olar sanalyp görkezilýär; hiç zadyň üstünden ýazylmaýar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidecars Culla wrote are put back as they were, unless they were changed since. No file moves." : {
      "comment" : "The confirmation alert of Undo Apply, after Mark Only: what undoing does.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Файлы XMP, записанные Culla, станут такими, как были, если с тех пор они не изменялись. Файлы не перемещаются."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Culla ýazan XMP faýllary öňki ýagdaýyna getirilýär, ýöne şondan bäri üýtgedilenlerine degilmeýär. Hiç bir faýl geçirilmeýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thumbnail could not be saved." : {
      "comment" : "Why a photo has no thumbnail: shown in the inspector and tile tooltip when the small preview could not be stored.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Не удалось сохранить миниатюру."
