        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” can’t be found" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an alert when a recent shoot's folder or a dropped folder no longer exists. %@ is the folder's name, in quotes.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Папка «%@» не найдена"
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» tapylmady"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” can’t be opened" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an alert when a folder exists but could not be read. %@ is the folder's name, in quotes.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Не удаётся открыть «%@»"
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» bukjasyny açyp bolmady"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has its own settings from its Adjust panel, so changes here apply to other shoots. Counts show what these would flag in it." : {
      "comment" : "A note at the top of each detection pane of Settings when the open shoot was adjusted from its own tuning panel ('Adjust' panel). %@ is the shoot's folder name; keep the quotation marks of your language around it.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У съёмки «%@» свои настройки из её панели «Настройка», поэтому изменения здесь действуют на другие съёмки. Числа показывают, что эти настройки пометили бы в ней."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» bukjasynyň sazlaýyş panelinden alnan öz sazlamalary bar, şonuň üçin bu ýerdäki üýtgeşmeler beýleki bukjalara degişli. Sanlar bu sazlamalaryň onda näçe suraty bellejekdigini görkezýär."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is not a folder" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an alert when the person drops or opens a file instead of a folder. %@ is the file's name, in quotes.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» — не папка"
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» bukja däl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is only read. Undo Apply removes the copies again." : {
      "comment" : "Review and Apply on a read-only shoot: the last line of what Copy Keepers will do. %@ is the shoot folder's name (never translated). 'Undo Apply' is a menu command.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Папка «%@» только читается. Команда «Отменить применение» удалит копии."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» bukjasy diňe okalýar. «Ulanmagy yzyna al» nusgalary ýene aýyrýar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” moved to %@; Culla followed it. Every decision is kept." : {
      "comment" : "A notice at the bottom of the window after opening a shoot whose folder was moved. %1$@ is the folder's old name, %2$@ its new path (such as ~/Pictures/Trip). Culla is the app's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” moved to %2$@; Culla followed it. Every decision is kept."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Папка «%1$@» перемещена в %2$@; Culla продолжает работать с ней. Все решения сохранены."
          }
        },
        "tk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%1$@» bukjasy şu ýere geçirilipdir: %2$@. Culla ony tapdy. Ähli kararlar saklandy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "−1 is what Lightroom and Bridge read as rejected." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under 'Rating for rejects' in Settings ▸ General ▸ Sidecars. Lightroom and Bridge are Adobe apps; keep their names.",
